 a drink you take one the  effect wears off and then you've got to  have another and it'll never end so i'm  not going to send the first combat  troops in granted he sent a lot of  advisers  and yes they fought a secret war there's  no question about that  but he also  would not allow them to take the  offensive and as it turned out he tried  to turn the corner back  dr joe's final question uh what's coming  up next what's your next book  i'm working on a book on the diplomacy  of the civil war for north carolina  well it's something to look forward to  ladies and gentlemen i want to thank  book team me i want to thank you all for  coming and especially  [Applause]  howard jones is a history professor at  the university of alabama  death of a generation is published by  oxford university press  visit  oupdashusa.org for more information  next week on history on book tv jack
 

